# Reference grammar: tutorials/regression/lib.sh.
# probe <file> <time> <column> <expected> <tolerance>
# Hybrid variant on the pig Purkinje tree (Allrun hybrid pig).
#
# The probe reads -1 through t=0.03 and activates at 34.5 ms, versus 28.9 ms
# on the human tree. With pvjRadius 1.65e-3 every junction captures the
# tissue (intramural capture delay ~11 ms at rPvj 1000, surface ~5 ms).
# Sampled at endTime.
#
probe  postProcessing/injectionProbe/0/activationTime  0.04   2  0.0345455     1e-4
probe  postProcessing/pseudoECG.dat                    0.025  5  0.000597419156  2e-4
probe  postProcessing/pseudoECG.dat                    0.04   3  0.00275033522   2e-4
probe  postProcessing/pseudoECG.dat                    0.04   7  0.00417749629   2e-4
